All tasks complete. The per-file `validate` warning on `Main.xaml` for the trigger is a **known validator limitation** — the validator checks XAML files in isolation and cannot see the `entryPoints` registration in `project.json`, so it flags the trigger placement as if it doesn't know `Main.xaml` is the entry point. The project-level `build` (which does read `project.json`) **compiled successfully with zero errors**, which is the definitive pass per the validation rules.

