### What was built

**7 nodes, 6 edges** implementing the same triage logic as before, now as a native Maestro Flow:

| Node | Type | What it does |
|---|---|---|
| **Email Received** | `connector.trigger` (O365) | Fires when a new email arrives in Outlook Inbox (polling) |
| **Classify Email** | `core.action.script` | Scores urgency: VIP sender (+2 pts) + urgent keyword (+1 pt) → Critical / Priority / Standard; builds a priority tag like `[CRITICAL [VIP]]` |
| **Forward to Support Queue** | `connector.activity` (O365 forward-email) | Forwards the email to your support queue inbox |
| **Is Critical?** | `core.logic.decision` | Branches: Critical → alert path, everything else → end |
| **Alert Team Lead** | `connector.activity` (O365 send-email) | Sends an immediate alert email to the team lead |
| **End (×2)** | `core.control.end` | Terminal nodes for both paths |

